# tests/x691/real.asn1 in UNALIGNED PER: random values only, against pycrate, asn1c
# and rasn. The reference deviations below were found by those checks.
deviates pycrate R
deviates pycrate RC
deviates pycrate S
deviates-encode asn1c R
deviates-encode asn1c RC
deviates-encode asn1c S
deviates rasn R
deviates rasn RC
deviates rasn S
